<title>UK: Russia sets 2.0 bln mark seven-year bond, +370 bp.</title>
<headline>Russia sets 2.0 bln mark seven-year bond, +370 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Suisse First Boston and Deutsche</p>
<p>Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RUSSIA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     9.00	MATURITY    25.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    25.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.75	REOFFER    100.00    SPREAD	+370 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/RU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  RUSSIA    TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  0.50</p>
</text>
